# AptiorDesk does not use environment variables for configuration.
#
# API keys are entered in the app (Settings -> AI Providers) and stored in your
# operating system's credential manager — never in a file like this one. That
# is deliberate: a .env file is easy to commit by accident, sync to the cloud,
# or include in a bug report.
#
# This file exists only to document the handful of variables that affect
# development and testing.

# Qt platform plugin. Set to "offscreen" to run the test suite headlessly,
# as CI does. Not needed for normal use.
# QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen

# Override the log level (default INFO). Logs stay on your machine and pass
# through a credential-redaction filter.
# APTIORDESK_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
